            <div xml:id="d562">

                <pb facs="0587" n="575" sameAs="frus:frus1941v01/pg575"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.24546/2: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-10-16T20:00:00+01:00">October 16, 1941—8
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received October 16—2:59 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4943. Your message 4458, October 15, 7 p.m. just received. I conveyed contents to
                    Mr. Eden. He promised prompt action.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Winant</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
